                                                </span>
                                            </a>
                                        </li>
                                                                            <li>
                                            <a href="#section-2">
                                                <span class="txt">Choices of rental properties for international students</span>
                                                <span class="arrow">
                                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M13.2,8.3c-0.4-0.4-1-0.4-1.4,0L9,11.1V3c0-0.6-0.4-1-1-1S7,2.4,7,3v8.1L4.2,8.3c-0.4-0.4-1-0.4-1.4,0s-0.4,1,0,1.4L8,14.9l5.2-5.2C13.6,9.3,13.6,8.7,13.2,8.3z"/></svg>
